@title Commissioning: a Blocking punch item draws a red triangle with a popover
@area Commissioning
@sizes 1366x768
# T13: Punch tab at 1366x768. A Blocking item gets a red triangle on its row and on the wire or device; a Minor item has none. Won't fix takes the triangle away.
open_starter_example
wait 20
click_text Commissioning #1
wait 20
click_text Punch
wait 10
click 170 259
text Loose lug at the motor
click_text Minor
wait 4
click_text Blocking
wait 4
click_text Add
wait 10
shot blocking-row
expect "Error: Blocking punch item"
click_text "Error: Blocking punch item"
wait 6
shot popover
expect "Open"
expect "Copy"
key Escape
wait 4
click_text "Won't fix"
wait 10
expect_not "Error: Blocking punch item"
shot gone
check_layout
